# PAT Scanner default patterns
# One regex per line. Trailing `# Name` comment becomes the stderr message on block.
#
# Format requirements (learned the hard way — see README "POSIX ERE gotchas"):
# - POSIX ERE syntax only (no PCRE). Use `(...)` not `(?:...)`, `[[:space:]]` not `\s`.
# - POSIX character classes ([[:space:]]) CANNOT be inside bracket expressions —
#   the inner `]` closes the bracket early. Use separate alternation branches instead.
# - Smoke-test each pattern with `echo "<sample>" | grep -E "<pattern>"` before relying on it.
#
# To customize: copy this file to ~/.config/secret-patterns.local and edit there.
# User file takes precedence over these defaults (preserved across plugin updates).

# === High-confidence credential prefixes ===
figd_[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{40,}                                                          # Figma PAT
sk-ant-(admin01|api03)-[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{93}AA([`'";]|[[:space:]]|\\[nr]|$)            # Anthropic (note AA suffix + terminator)
sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{20}T3BlbkFJ[A-Za-z0-9]{20}                                         # OpenAI legacy (T3BlbkFJ = base64 "OpenAI")
sk-proj-[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{58}T3BlbkFJ[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{58}                             # OpenAI project
gh[pousr]_[0-9a-zA-Z]{36}                                                         # GitHub classic PAT/OAuth/u2s/s2s/refresh
github_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{82}                                                       # GitHub fine-grained
xox[baprs]-[0-9a-zA-Z\-]{10,}                                                     # Slack bot/app/user/refresh/legacy
(sk|rk|pk)_(test|live|prod)_[a-zA-Z0-9]{10,99}                                    # Stripe test/live/relimited keys
pypi-AgEIcHlwaS5vcmc[A-Za-z0-9\-_]{50,1000}                                       # PyPI token
[0-9a-f]{32}\.[A-Za-z0-9]{16}                                                     # Z.ai / Zhipu API key (id.secret)
eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{10,}\.[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{10,}\.[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{10,}                  # Generic JWT (catches Z.ai JWT + others)
ak_ntl_prod_[A-Za-z0-9]{36}                                                       # Natural.com (unverified shape)
AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}                                                                  # AWS access key ID
